📦 Unified Kernel Driver (MAX31865 + nRF52840 bridge)
Features:
Reads RTD temperature from MAX31865 over SPI
Converts raw RTD value → temperature (simplified)
Sends value over SPI to nRF52840
Exposes /sys/.../temperature
Uses workqueue (safe kernel design)

spi0.0 → MAX31865
spi0.1 → nRF52840

📡 Device Tree (Raspberry Pi 3)

&spi0 {
	status = "okay";

	max31865@0 {
		compatible = "rpi,max31865_nrf52840_bridge";
		reg = <0>;
		spi-max-frequency = <500000>;
	};

	nrf52840@1 {
		reg = <1>;
		spi-max-frequency = <2000000>;
	};
};